---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="NAUTERA | Ekosistem Tata Kelola & Rantai Pasok Udang Vaname" description="NAUTERA mengintegrasikan budidaya berkelanjutan hulu (KSO SOP Presisi), pengembangan SDM Nautera Academy, hingga hilirisasi pasokan Shrimply bermutu tinggi.">
<main>
<!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="hero-bg-media">
        <img src="/assets/images/background-home.png" alt="Nautera Hero Background" onerror="if(!this.dataset.tried){this.dataset.tried=1;this.src='/assets/images/background-home.jpg';}else{this.style.display='none';}">
      </div>
      <div class="hero-overlay-grid"></div>
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content reveal">
          <h1>Quality Shrimps For<br>Your Business and<br>Family</h1>
          <p>Udang vaname segar berkualitas dengan proses budidaya dan penanganan yang tepat, mendukung kebutuhan bisnis sekaligus menghadirkan pilihan terbaik untuk keluarga.</p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/contact?type=family" class="btn btn-primary">Pesan sekarang</a>
            <a href="/contact?type=b2b" class="btn btn-secondary">Hubungi Sales B2B</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-float-card">
            <span class="hero-float-dot"></span>
            <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary-dark);">Pasokan Segar Harian &bull; Rantai Pasok Terjamin</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Definition of Nautera Section (Theme: Soft Natural Green matched to From Nature) -->
    <section class="definition-section">
      <div style="position: absolute; top: -10%; right: -5%; width: 450px; height: 450px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201, 223, 138, 0.4) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; animation: floatSlow 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;"></div>
      <div style="position: absolute; bottom: -10%; left: -5%; width: 450px; height: 450px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(119, 171, 89, 0.25) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; animation: floatSlow 10s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse;"></div>
      
      <div class="container reveal-scale">
        <div class="definition-card-inner">
          
          <div class="definition-badge">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i> Definition of Nautera
          </div>
          
          <span class="definition-quote-icon">&ldquo;</span>
          
          <p style="color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
            Nautera adalah ekosistem budidaya dan tata kelola udang vaname terintegrasi &mdash; menghubungkan komitmen jujur petambak di hulu, pengolahan higienis &amp; rantai pasok bersama Shrimply, serta kepastian mutu terjamin di hilir.
          </p>

          <div class="definition-pillars-grid">
            
            <!-- Pillar 1: Hulu -->
            <div class="def-pillar-item reveal-scale delay-100">
              <div class="fa-icon-box">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-wheat-awn"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="def-pillar-content">
                <h4>Hulu (Farm &amp; Kemitraan)</h4>
                <span>Budi daya berkelanjutan bersama petambak binaan</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar 2: Nautera Academy -->
            <div class="def-pillar-item reveal-scale delay-200">
              <div class="fa-icon-box" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 52px; height: 52px;">
                <img src="/assets/images/shrimp-mascot.png" alt="Nautera Academy Mascot" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; object-fit: contain;">
              </div>
              <div class="def-pillar-content">
                <h4>Nautera Academy</h4>
                <span>SOP presisi, mitigasi risiko &amp; bimbingan SDM</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar 3: Nautera Supply -->
            <div class="def-pillar-item reveal-scale delay-300">
              <div class="fa-icon-box">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="def-pillar-content">
                <h4>Nautera Supply</h4>
                <span>Suplai pakan berkualitas, benur SPF &amp; saprotam</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar 4: Shrimply (Hilir & Distribusi) -->
            <div class="def-pillar-item reveal-scale delay-400">
              <div class="fa-icon-box">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-snowflake"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="def-pillar-content">
                <h4>Shrimply (Hilir &amp; Distribusi)</h4>
                <span>Pengolahan higienis, rantai dingin &amp; pasokan terintegrasi</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Dari Alam untuk Kualitas Terbaik Section -->
    <section class="timeline-nature-section" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 5rem 0;">
      <div class="container" style="position: relative;">
        <div class="timeline-intro reveal">
          <h2>From Nature For The Best Quality</h2>
          <div class="timeline-intro-line">
            <span class="timeline-intro-leaf"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
          </div>
          <p>Dari kemurnian alam pesisir hingga ke dapur Anda, setiap langkah kami kawal dengan standar presisi tinggi demi menjaga kesegaran dan mutu udang terbaik.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="timeline-flow-container" style="position: relative;">
          <!-- HTML5 Particle Flow Canvas (Connecting Flow like amalproduktif.or.id) -->
          <canvas id="timelineFlowCanvas" style="position: absolute; top: 42px; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100px; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1; display: block;"></canvas>

          <div class="timeline-desktop-row" style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
            <!-- Step 1 -->
            <div class="timeline-col reveal">
              <div class="timeline-img-box">
                <div class="img-slot" style="height: 185px; min-height: 185px; max-height: 185px; border-radius: 20px;">
                  <img src="/assets/images/st1.png" alt="Budidaya Berkelanjutan" loading="lazy">
                  <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">step-1.webp</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-badge-row">
                <span class="timeline-badge-circle">01</span> Budidaya Berkelanjutan
              </div>
              <p>Kami memulai dari alam. Tambak dikelola secara ramah lingkungan untuk menjaga ekosistem seimbang dan hasil optimal.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Step 2 -->
            <div class="timeline-col reveal delay-100">
              <div class="timeline-img-box">
                <div class="img-slot" style="height: 185px; min-height: 185px; max-height: 185px; border-radius: 20px;">
                  <img src="/assets/images/st2.png" alt="Panen Selektif" loading="lazy">
                  <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">step-2.webp</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-badge-row">
                <span class="timeline-badge-circle">02</span> Panen Selektif
              </div>
              <p>Udang dipanen dengan seleksi ketat untuk memastikan keseragaman ukuran, kesehatan, dan kesegaran terbaik.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Step 3 -->
            <div class="timeline-col reveal delay-200">
              <div class="timeline-img-box">
                <div class="img-slot" style="height: 185px; min-height: 185px; max-height: 185px; border-radius: 20px;">
                  <img src="/assets/images/st3.png" alt="Sortir & Penanganan Dingin" loading="lazy">
                  <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">step-3.webp</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-badge-row">
                <span class="timeline-badge-circle">03</span> Sortir &amp; Penanganan Dingin
              </div>
              <p>Udang langsung disortir teliti dan direndam dalam es (slurry ice) pasca panen untuk menjaga kesegaran alami tanpa bahan pengawet.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Step 4 -->
            <div class="timeline-col reveal delay-300">
              <div class="timeline-img-box">
                <div class="img-slot" style="height: 185px; min-height: 185px; max-height: 185px; border-radius: 20px;">
                  <img src="/assets/images/st4.png" alt="Distribusi Terjaga" loading="lazy">
                  <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">step-4.webp</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-badge-row">
                <span class="timeline-badge-circle">04</span> Distribusi Terjaga
              </div>
              <p>Dikirim dengan sistem rantai dingin terjaga agar udang tiba di tangan Anda dalam kondisi segar alami.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Budi Daya Berkelanjutan Section -->
    <section style="background-color: var(--color-primary-very-light); border-top: 1px solid rgba(119,171,89,0.1); padding: 4.25rem 0;">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="reveal" style="text-align: center; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.65rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);">Sustainably Grown, Naturally Better</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--color-text-light);">Udang yang lebih bernutrisi lahir dari lingkungan yang terawat. Kami menjaga kelestarian pesisir demi menciptakan sistem tambak produktif yang ramah lingkungan.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="budidaya-layout">
          <!-- Left: 6 list items -->
          <div class="budidaya-left-list reveal">
            <div class="budidaya-list-item">
              <div class="budidaya-list-header">
                <span class="budidaya-list-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-users" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
                <h4>Pengembangan SDM</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Membangun kapasitas dan kompetensi tenaga kerja yang adaptif serta berintegritas tinggi.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="budidaya-list-item">
              <div class="budidaya-list-header">
                <span class="budidaya-list-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-microscope" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
                <h4>Monitoring Rutin</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Pemantauan kualitas air dan kesehatan udang secara berkala untuk pencegahan dini.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="budidaya-list-item">
              <div class="budidaya-list-header">
                <span class="budidaya-list-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-sack-dollar" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
                <h4>Biaya Efisien</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Operasional berbasis data presisi demi efisiensi FCR dan produktivitas maksimal.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="budidaya-list-item">
              <div class="budidaya-list-header">
                <span class="budidaya-list-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
                <h4>Jaga Mangrove</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Rehabilitasi ekosistem pesisir demi kelestarian habitat dan keberlanjutan lingkungan.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="budidaya-list-item">
              <div class="budidaya-list-header">
                <span class="budidaya-list-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shrimp" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
                <h4>Panen Berkualitas</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Udang sehat, ukuran seragam, dan aman dikonsumsi tanpa residu kimia terlarang.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="budidaya-list-item">
              <div class="budidaya-list-header">
                <span class="budidaya-list-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
                <h4>Sertifikasi Terjamin</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Tambak dan fasilitas hilir kami telah melalui audit standar kelayakan dan halal resmi.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Right: 2 photo cards -->
          <div class="budidaya-right-cards reveal delay-200">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="budidaya-photo-card">
              <div class="img-slot">
                <img src="/assets/images/ps1 (1).jpg" alt="Dikelola Profesional" loading="lazy">
                <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"></span><span class="slot-name"></span></div>
                <!-- Floating Glowing Dots (Nautera Natural Palette) -->
                <span class="floating-glow-dot dot-lime" style="width: 16px; height: 16px; top: 16%; right: 18%; animation-delay: 0s;"></span>
                <span class="floating-glow-dot dot-sage" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 56%; left: 14%; animation-delay: 1.2s;"></span>
                <span class="floating-glow-dot dot-primary" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; bottom: 12%; right: 40%; animation-delay: 2.3s;"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="budidaya-photo-content">
                <span class="budidaya-pill-title">Dikelola Profesional</span>
                <p>Tim ahli berpengalaman memastikan setiap tahapan budidaya berjalan dengan SOP presisi.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="budidaya-photo-card">
              <div class="img-slot">
                <img src="/assets/images/ps1 (2).jpg" alt="Udang Sehat, Konsumen Tenang" loading="lazy">
                <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"></span><span class="slot-name"></span></div>
                <!-- Floating Glowing Dots (Nautera Natural Palette) -->
                <span class="floating-glow-dot dot-primary" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 18%; left: 16%; animation-delay: 0.6s;"></span>
                <span class="floating-glow-dot dot-lime" style="width: 16px; height: 16px; top: 50%; right: 16%; animation-delay: 1.8s;"></span>
                <span class="floating-glow-dot dot-sage" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; bottom: 14%; left: 38%; animation-delay: 2.9s;"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="budidaya-photo-content">
                <span class="budidaya-pill-title">Udang Sehat, Konsumen Tenang</span>
                <p>Dibudidayakan secara bertanggung jawab untuk menghadirkan rasa manis alami yang aman dan lezat.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Environmental Values Card Refined -->
        <div class="env-values-block-refined reveal">
          <div class="env-values-left-rows">
            <!-- Top Light Row -->
            <div class="env-row-light">
              <div class="env-row-light-left">
                <span class="env-row-light-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf" style="color: var(--color-primary);"></i></span>
                <span>Kami percaya, budidaya yang sukses adalah yang memberi manfaat bagi manusia dan alam.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="env-row-light-divider"></div>
              <div class="env-row-light-right">
                Sehat Alamnya<br>Berkah Hasilnya
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Bottom Dark Row -->
            <div class="env-row-dark">
              <!-- Col 1 -->
              <div class="env-row-dark-col">
                <div class="env-row-dark-icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i></div>
                <div class="env-row-dark-text">
                  <h4>Ramah Lingkungan</h4>
                  <p>Selaras dengan alam, berkelanjutan selamanya</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Col 2 -->
              <div class="env-row-dark-col">
                <div class="env-row-dark-icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
                <div class="env-row-dark-text">
                  <h4>Aman &amp; Tepercaya</h4>
                  <p>Proses higienis, mutu terjamin konsisten</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Col 3 -->
              <div class="env-row-dark-col">
                <div class="env-row-dark-icon-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i></div>
                <div class="env-row-dark-text">
                  <h4>Bersama Masyarakat</h4>
                  <p>Memberi dampak ekonomi dan membuka lapangan kerja</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="env-banner-right-side">
            <!-- Halal Stamp -->
            <div class="cert-stamp-refined" title="Halal Indonesia">
              <img src="/assets/images/halal.jpg" alt="Halal Indonesia" class="cert-img" onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';">
              <div class="cert-fallback" style="display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
                <span class="cert-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-star-and-crescent"></i></span>
                <span class="cert-name">HALAL<br>INDONESIA</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- HACCP Stamp -->
            <div class="cert-stamp-refined" title="Food Safety HACCP Certified">
              <img src="/assets/images/haccp.avif" alt="Food Safety HACCP Certified" class="cert-img" onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';">
              <div class="cert-fallback" style="display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
                <span class="cert-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield"></i></span>
                <span class="cert-name">FOOD SAFETY<br>HACCP<br>CERTIFIED</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pengembangan SDM Akuakultur Section -->
    <section style="background-color: var(--color-bg-white);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="reveal">
            <span class="section-label">Nautera Academy</span>
            <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Aquaculture Talent Development</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              Membentuk praktisi dan teknisi tambak profesional yang terampil, disiplin memantau data harian, dan berintegritas untuk memajukan industri udang nusantara.
            </p>
            
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Building Competence, Ensuring Quality</h3>
            <p>Keberhasilan tambak udang intensif ditentukan oleh keahlian, kejelian, dan rasa tanggung jawab dari Sumber Daya Manusia (SDM) yang mengelolanya sehari-hari.</p>
            <p>Nautera Academy menjembatani kesenjangan keahlian antara teori akuakultur akademik dan praktik lapangan tambak intensif melalui pelatihan berbasis data nyata, uji laboratorium parameter air, serta mitigasi risiko biosekuriti praktis.</p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
              <a href="/for-growers#academy-details" class="btn btn-primary">GABUNG ACADEMY NAUTERA <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="reveal delay-200" style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
            <div class="academy-photo-card" style="width: 100%;">
              <div class="img-slot">
                <img src="/assets/images/aca.jpg" alt="Nautera Academy Students Learning" loading="lazy">
                <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">academy-classroom.webp</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="academy-photo-overlay">
                Akuakultur & Sains Kelautan
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Giant Cooked Shrimp Banner Section -->
    <section class="giant-banner-section">
      <div class="img-slot img-slot-flush" style="position:absolute;inset:0;min-height:0;z-index:0;border-radius:0;">
        <img src="/assets/images/u1.jpg" alt="Hidangan Udang Premium" loading="lazy">
        <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">cooked-shrimp-plate.webp</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="giant-banner-overlay"></div>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="giant-banner-content reveal">
          <h2>Serving Premium Fresh Shrimps<br>to Every Corner<br>of the World</h2>
          <p>Menyajikan lebih dari <span class="stat-counter" data-counter-target="150000" data-counter-suffix="+" data-counter-step="134">150.000+</span> porsi udang siap saji berkualitas tinggi setiap harinya untuk keluarga dan mitra kuliner</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cerita dan Insight Section -->
    <section id="insights" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-white);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header center reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Edukasi &amp; Industri</span>
          <h2>Stories &amp; Industry Insights</h2>
          <p>Edukasi praktis, kabar terkini seputar dunia tambak, standar cold-chain, dan penerapan biosekuriti dari praktisi lapangan.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid-3">
          <!-- Article 1 -->
          <div class="card article-card reveal">
            <div class="img-slot">
              <img src="/assets/images/insight-academy-training.webp" alt="Nautera Academy Field Training" loading="lazy">
              <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">insight-academy-training.webp</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="article-card-content">
              <span class="insight-card-meta">SDM &amp; Keahlian</span>
              <h3>Mencetak SDM Tambak Profesional: Mengubah Intuisi Menjadi Keputusan Presisi</h3>
              <p>Pelajari bagaimana Nautera Academy membekali teknisi lapangan dengan disiplin SOP, manajemen pakan presisi, dan analisis data harian untuk menekan risiko kegagalan tambak.</p>
              <a href="/blog#mencetak-sdm-tambak" class="btn-text" style="padding-left: 0;">Selengkapnya <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Article 2 -->
          <div class="card article-card reveal delay-100">
            <div class="img-slot">
              <img src="/assets/images/insight-cold-chain.webp" alt="Cold Chain Management" loading="lazy">
              <div class="img-slot-fallback"><span class="slot-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></span><span class="slot-name">insight-cold-chain.webp</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="article-card-content">
              <span class="insight-card-meta">Hasil Panen &amp; Industri</span>
              <h3>Menjaga Kesegaran Udang Vaname: Pentingnya Cold-Chain dari Tambak hingga Dapur</h3>
              <p>Temukan rahasia menjaga kualitas tekstur daging udang tetap padat dan bebas amis melalui penanganan pasca panen berbasis rantai dingin (ice slurry) standar Nautera.</p>
              <a href="/blog#menjaga-kesegaran-cold-chain" class="btn-text" style="padding-left: 0;">Selengkapnya <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Article 3 -->
          <div class="card article-card reveal delay-200">
            <div class="img-slot">
              <img src="/assets/images/insight-biosecure.webp" alt="Biosekuritas Tambak" loading="lazy">
